  {
    "type": "function",
    "function": {
      "name": "update_working_checkpoint",
      "description": "Update working memory (key_info). This block is re-injected into the model view at the end of every round as [WORKING MEMORY]: keep it a compact, up-to-date anchor of the current task — goal, key facts, decisions, next step. Store phase conclusions and important findings in time; do not repeat unchanged content. Clear stale parts when the task changes.",
